ICOSale.setMinUsdPerTx

when called by the owner with a non-zero value
    it updates minUsdPerTx to the new value
        expect minUsdPerTx == newValue
    it emits MinUsdPerTxUpdated
        expect event with correct parameters

when called by the owner and overwriting a previous non-zero value
    it updates and emits correctly
        expect minUsdPerTx == newValue and event emitted

when _minUsdPerTx is zero
    it reverts and does not change state
        expect revert with Errors.ZeroAmount

when called by a non-owner
    it reverts and does not change state
        expect revert with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount error
